s Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此网络中有 %1$d 个站点被设置为在删除插件时清除其 Babilim 身份。之后将无法自动恢复绑定到这些站点的付费许可证；您需要通过 %2$s 联系 Babilim 支持。若要保留身份，请点击“取消”，在各站点的 Babilim 设置中取消勾选“卸载时删除所有 Babilim 数据”，然后重新停用。仍要停用吗？','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此网络中的站点过多，无法逐一检查，其中部分站点可能设置了在插件被删除时清除其 Babilim 身份信息。这类站点所绑定的付费许可证之后将无法自动恢复；您需要通过 %s 联系 Babilim 支持。若要保留这些身份信息，请点击“取消”，在每个站点的 Babilim 设置中取消勾选“卸载时删除所有 Babilim 数据”，然后重新停用。仍要停用吗？','Open Babilim settings'=>'打开 Babilim 设置','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim 无法验证此站点，因此不会下载或安装任何内容。','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'服务无法连接到您的站点。可能是防火墙、安全插件或主机规则拦截了请求，请允许对 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 的请求。','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'您的站点响应超时。请稍后重试，并检查您的主机是否过慢或负载过高。','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'您的站点有响应，但返回的内容不符合预期。REST API 可能被其他插件改写，或该端点被缓存；请将 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 排除在缓存和改写之外。','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'请检查您的站点能否从互联网访问，然后重试。','Re-verify'=>'重新验证','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and