e translation files.'=>'您的 WordPress 版本,用于提供兼容的翻译文件。','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'您的 PHP 版本,用于兼容性判断。','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'本插件自身的版本,以便在版本过旧而无法通信时,服务能提示您更新。','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'本站点配置的区域设置。','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'本站点使用的所有区域设置(站点区域设置、已安装的语言包、用户区域设置,以及您手动添加的区域设置)。各区域设置之间一视同仁。','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(为本站点生成的公钥)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'本站点的安装公钥,用于证明请求确实来自本站点。仅会发送公钥部分。','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'每个已安装的插件/主题:其 slug、版本、text domain、是否为 WordPress.org 上架项目、自带的区域设置,以及您已安装 Babilim 翻译的区域设置。','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'仅当您确认上传不在 WordPress.org 上的插件或主题时:将该组件的整个目录打包为 zip 上传。','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(仅限通用代码和坐标)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'最多 20 条待处理的诊断事件(例如未通过完整性检查的文件),每条仅包含代码、组件和区域设置,绝不包含任何字符串内容或译文。','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'不安全的区域设置:%s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'清单不可用:%s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'无法确定已启用的组件;现有的合并索引保持不变。','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'无法确定已安装的插件/主题;已跳过扫描,未删除任何内容。','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'扫描已中止,未将任何内容标记为孤立:%s。','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'清理已执行,但部分更改未能记录到翻译索引中;下次清理时将重试。','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'“%s”的合并索引已重建,但翻译索引未能记录;下次重建时将重试。','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'无法写入暂存的合并索引。','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'重新解析的条目数与构建的索引不一致。','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'无法将“%s”的合并索引移动到位;为避免只更新一半,之前提供的索引(如有)已被删除。在下次成功重建之前,不会为该区域设置提供默认域补充翻译。','Could not open zip: %s'=>'无法打开 zip:%s','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip 中没有 manifest.json。','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'zip 中的 manifest.json 不是有效的 JSON。','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json 的“%s”与预期值不符。','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'另一个安装正在进行;请稍后再试。','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'不是有效的 server_build_id:%s','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'包清单自身的类型“%1$s”与请求的类型“%2$s”不符。','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'包的 text domain“%1$s”与本站点该组件的副本(“%2$s”)不符,因此未安装。','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'给定的域“%1$s”既不匹配包清单自身的 slug“%2$s”,也不匹配其 text_domain“%3$s”。','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'不安全的 slug:%s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'不安全的 text_domain:%s','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'该包没有适用于其自身文本域的 %s。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json 中的“%s”字段缺失或无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 中的“entries”字段缺失或无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json 中的“files”字段缺失或无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json 中的“extra_domains”字段缺失或无效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json 中的“build_no”字段缺失或无效。','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json 的“server_build_id”不是有效的构建 ID。','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json 的“contract”不是有效的版本字符串。','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“状态”（status）必须为“published”。','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“kind”必须为“plugin”或“主题”（theme）。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“default_domain_entries”无效。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json 的“default_domain_files”无效。','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest 中的“%s”字段缺失或无效。','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest 的“server_build_id”不是有效的构建 ID。','No record for %s'=>'没有 %s 的记录','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'一个或多个已提供的文件与 manifest 不再一致。','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'没有可回滚的上一个构建。','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'无法将此更改记录到翻译索引中，请重试。','Unknown kind: %s'=>'未知的类型：%s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'不安全的域：%s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'文本域“%1$s”（%2$s）已用于另一个已安装的组件（%3$s），未安装任何内容。','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'回滚将覆盖“%1$s”（%2$s），该文件目前已用于另一个已安装的组件（%3$s），未更改任何内容。','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip 包缺少预期文件：%s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 sha256 不匹配','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'该包未声明主翻译文件。','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip 包缺少预期的 default 文件：%s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s 的 sha256 不匹配','Could not stage %s'=>'无法暂存 %s','Could n